  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/taint3/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE. Reviewed 2026-11-01 on dev 100b6fbb6e. Half (1) reproduces: _extract_import_hints on 'import java.nio.file._ / import java.io._' returns {'file':'java.nio.file','io':'java.io'}, and in hypergumbo run 'def f(x: File) = x.delete()' and 'fw: FileWriter ... fw.write' keep scala:external:0-0. Half (2) is mostly fixed by INV-dibij (cd93704544, 2026-10-25): declared receivers of bare java.lang types now get the module (Thread.start -> scala:java.lang.Thread, String.getBytes -> java.lang.String, ProcessBuilder.start -> java.lang.ProcessBuilder); WI-tunul (5421db2471) covers Console/Predef. MECHANISM: wildcard import falls into the last-identifier-is-the-short-name fallback; no wildcard-package disjunction for the module slot."  # e793
